  "boundary": "Current unofficial local client only: source-traced native model store/IPC, optional nonshipping host llama.cpp checks, local browser authentication and private-app loopback handoff, nested generic schemas/errors, native build hooks and bundled asset selection. Eight explicit profiles bind the two actual all-WebGPU APK ABIs and existing Linux/Windows default-library/inference/inference+store checks. Browser WebGPU/NPM and Android JVM dependencies have separate inventories; no OpenChat backend, removed custom card/action-inbox canisters, release-canister tooling, core dependency audit, advisory acceptance, model quality, device runtime or publication approval is claimed. Historical PR2 inventories remain verbatim historical evidence and are not current build acceptance.",
